Package: lindos-setup
Version: 1.0.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lindos Team <team@lindos.dev>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, lindos-core, xdg-utils
Recommends: lindos-compat, lindos-gaming, librsvg2-common
Suggests: lindos-settings, lindos-desktop
Homepage: https://lindos.dev
Description: Lindos first-boot setup (Out-Of-Box Experience)
 A Windows-11-style first-run wizard for Lindos. At first login it lets the
 user pick a Mode (Everyday, Gaming, Work, Creator, Lite), a web browser
 (Firefox is on the ISO; Microsoft Edge and Google Chrome are downloaded from
 the vendors' official repositories because their licences forbid
 redistribution), a dark or light theme, accent colour, wallpaper, taskbar
 alignment, optional apps (Windows app support through Wine/Proton, Steam,
 Roblox via Sober, Minecraft via Prism, Heroic, Lutris, Bottles, OnlyOffice,
 creative apps) and privacy preferences, then applies everything through
 lindos-core with a single privileged helper call per group.
 .
 Run "lindos-setup --reconfigure" to go through the wizard again.
